        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFBS25, Extra Large 2-1/2 Inch Modern Square Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Oversized Universal Floor Bumper is perfect for large spaces. It's big, so it will be sure to stand out even amongst the largest doors. It is 2-1/2 inches tall and has a base width of 1-5/8 inches. This Extra Large 2-1/2 Inch Modern Square Door Stop is made out of solid brass, so it will definitely be able to withstand the test of time. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFBS25-specifications.gif?v=1704354611\" width\"389\" height=\"204\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana UFBS138 Modern Square Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIs this Mammoth Door Stopper too big for your application? Also Available Smaller <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-modern-square-door-stop-deltana-ufbs138\">1-3/8\" Modern Square Door Stop</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana UFBS25 Extra Large Square Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Bumper: 5/8\" x 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Black</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFBS25-specifications.pdf?v=1704262344\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana UFBS25 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
