                "description": "This Oversized Universal Floor Bumper is perfect for large spaces. It's big, so it will be sure to stand out even amongst the largest doors. It is 2-1/2 inches tall and has a base width of 1-5/8 inches. This Extra Large 2-1/2 Inch Modern Square Door Stop is made out of solid brass, so it will definitely be able to withstand the test of time.",
